        "B. \\(\\frac{1}{{{{\\tan }^2}\\alpha }} = 1 + {\\cot ^2}\\alpha \\left( {\\alpha \\ne \\frac{{k\\pi }}{2},k \\in \\mathbb{Z}} \\right)\\).",
        "C. \\({\\sin ^2}a + {\\cos ^2}b = 1\\).",
        "D. \\({\\cos ^4}\\alpha + {\\sin ^4}\\alpha = 1\\)."
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "note": "\\(\\frac{1}{{{{\\sin }^2}\\alpha }} = 1 + {\\cot ^2}\\alpha \\left( {\\alpha \\ne k\\pi ,k \\in \\mathbb{Z}} \\right)\\). Chọn A."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "content": "Câu 5: Cho \\(P = \\sin \\left( {\\pi + \\alpha } \\right)\\cos \\left( {\\pi - \\alpha } \\right)\\) và \\(Q = \\sin \\left( {\\frac{\\pi }{2} - \\alpha } \\right)\\cos \\left( {\\frac{\\pi }{2} + \\alpha } \\right)\\). Mệnh đề nào dưới đây là đúng?",
      "options": [
        "A. \\(P + Q = 0\\).",
        "B. \\(P + Q = - 1\\).",
        "C. \\(P + Q = 1\\).",
        "D. \\(P + Q = 2\\)."
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "note": "\\(P = \\sin \\left( {\\pi + \\alpha } \\right)\\cos \\left( {\\pi - \\alpha } \\right)\\)\\( = \\sin \\alpha \\cos \\alpha \\). \\(Q = \\sin \\left( {\\frac{\\pi }{2} - \\alpha } \\right)\\cos \\left( {\\frac{\\pi }{2} + \\alpha } \\right)\\)\\( = - \\cos \\alpha \\sin \\alpha \\). Suy ra \\(P + Q = 0\\). Chọn A."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
