      "options": [
        "A. \\(\\frac{4}{5}\\).",
        "B. \\( - \\frac{4}{5}\\).",
        "C. \\( - \\frac{2}{5}\\).",
        "D. \\(\\frac{2}{5}\\)."
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "note": "Vì \\(\\alpha \\in \\left( {\\frac{\\pi }{2};\\pi } \\right)\\) nên \\(\\cos \\alpha < 0\\). Có \\({\\cos ^2}\\alpha = 1 - {\\sin ^2}\\alpha = 1 - {\\left( {\\frac{3}{5}} \\right)^2} = \\frac{{16}}{{25}}\\) \\( \\Rightarrow \\cos \\alpha = - \\frac{4}{5}\\). Chọn B."
